      "widgets_values": [
        "Restore this image tile into a clean, detailed version of the same content. Preserve the exact composition, framing, perspective, object positions, proportions, identities, expressions, lighting, colors, and original medium.\n\nActively repair degradation inherited from the enlarged source: compression blocks, pixelation, noise, ringing, jagged contours, and damaged or smeared textures. Reconstruct coherent edges and plausible fine surface detail consistent with the visible subjects and materials. Preserve the scene's content, not its degradation. A heavily degraded region should receive meaningful restoration rather than merely reproducing its enlarged defects.\n\nKeep partially cropped objects and all features crossing the tile boundaries in exactly the same positions. Maintain consistent color balance and tonal relationships. Avoid artificial textures, exaggerated contrast, sharpening halos, and a plastic appearance. Do not add, remove, move, complete, or redesign objects. Do not guess missing text, change facial identity, crop, reframe, or stylize."
