      "widgets_values": [
        "RP TILE PIPELINE\n\nChoose only the tile count in RP Tile Split. Each tile is exactly 1024 x 1024. The image is resized once, without cropping. Outer edges are padded.\n\nThe tiles list feeds BOTH the prompt expander and the FLUX.3 reference. Decoded tiles go directly to RP Tile Merge, which uses tile_context to remove padding and apply per-tile/global color matching.\n\nKeep resolution must stay selected in Current Tile Reference. Preserve the tile list order. Output dimensions are shown above; proportions are preserved to the nearest pixel."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "RP TILE PIPELINE\n\nChoose only the tile count in RP Tile Split. Each tile is exactly 1024 x 1024. The image is resized once, without cropping. Outer edges are padded.\n\nThe tiles list feeds BOTH the prompt expander and the FLUX.3 reference. Decoded tiles go directly to RP Tile Merge, which uses tile_context to remove padding and apply per-tile/global color matching.\n\nKeep resolution must stay selected in Current Tile Reference. Preserve the tile list order. Output dimensions are shown above; proportions are preserved to the nearest pixel."
